**Swift:**

Available on iOS 16+, macOS 13+, and visionOS 1+. Requires `@_spi(Experimental) import Supabase`.

For lower-level control (or on tvOS/watchOS), use `getPasskeyRegistrationOptions()` + `verifyPasskeyRegistration(challengeId:credentialResponse:)` from the [Auth Passkey](https://supabase.com/docs/reference/swift/auth-passkey-api) reference.

The returned passkey contains the new credential's metadata:

